    "text": "Independence\nMan shot 3 victims in front of children in KC area home\n2 hours ago\nKANSAS CITY—A man is facing multiple charges in connection with a fatal shooting that also left two others injured in Independence, Missouri. Robert L. Cordato, 42, faces 1st Degree Murder, two counts of 1st Degree Assault, 1st Degree Burglary, Unlawful Possession of a Firearm, and four counts of Armed Criminal Action, according to the Jackson County Prosectutor's office.",
